            "heading": "What’s Inside",
            "uppercase_text": false,
            "content": "<p>A tear-out mission book built for real dads and their kids.</p><p>Inside, you’ll find funny, practical challenges designed to turn ordinary moments into memorable dad–kid adventures. Complete missions, collect stickers, fill the achievement poster and work your way towards the ultimate title: <strong>Best Dad in the World</strong>.</p><p>No perfect parenting required. Just questionable decisions, real bonding and stories worth remembering.</p>",
