            "heading": "Size & What’s Included",
            "uppercase_text": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>Book dimensions</strong></p><p>6.3 × 9 × 0.6 in (16 × 22.8 × 1.5 cm)<br/><br/>Weight: 1.0 lb (460 g)</p><p><strong>Included in the package</strong></p><p>The tear-out mission book<br/><br/>One Dad Achievement Poster<br/><br/>One themed sticker pack<br/><br/>One custom sticker envelope</p><p>Everything needed to start completing missions and earning Dad Supremacy immediately.</p>",
