            "content": "<p>Orders are normally shipped on the next business day and delivered within approximately <strong>5–7 business days</strong>.</p><p>We offer a <strong>30-day return period</strong> on full-price items. To qualify for a return, the book must remain unused, unopened and in its original plastic wrapping. No pages may be removed, no stickers used, and the poster must be unused and unmarked.</p><p>Return shipping costs are covered by the customer. Sale items, discounted products, gift cards and personalized items cannot be returned.</p><p>To request a return or report a damaged or incorrect order, contact <strong>info@bestdadbook.com</strong> before sending anything back. Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method after the returned item has been received and inspected.</p>",
