      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_PTdFTV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Is this book actually useful, or just another dad-gag gift?",
            "answer": "<p>Glad you asked! Sure, it’s funny as hell, but beneath the sarcasm is a stack of truly useful, step-by-step activities. It’s practical dad-ing, served with a side of laughs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_LKtWm6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do I need special equipment or a trip to Home Depot?",
            "answer": "<p>Nope! Each activity clearly lists what’s needed—and it's usually stuff already lurking around your house. Worst-case scenario? MacGyver your way through it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_WA9hga": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How long do these activities take? My schedule's chaos.",
            "answer": "<p>We’ve got you. Each activity clearly indicates whether it's a quick-and-easy five minutes or a full-day adventure. Choose according to your current chaos-level.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_eKc6jg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What's the deal with ripping out pages? Am I destroying the book?",
            "answer": "<p>Exactly. But think of it as productive destruction. You rip it, you own it, and now you're fully committed. It's like burning ships, but less dramatic.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_d4qt3z": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Why the centerfold? Sounds weird.",
            "answer": "<p>Remember sticker books from childhood? Same vibe. Complete an activity, slap a sticker on the dad-worthy centerfold, and voilà—you've got proof you're not just winging it (even though you totally are).</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_TGCJYP": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Is this book good for brand-new dads or seasoned veterans?",
            "answer": "<p>Both! Fresh dads will find survival hacks, seasoned pros will level-up their dad game, and everyone gets bonus points from their significant others. Win-win-win.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_wewBNF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
